# RESETIUS |   x=+[c40-@.5g++@2.414g|@q2f--f---@q2f]y-fw-
# RESETIUS |   x=[c40-@.5g++@2.414g|@q2f--f---@q2f]y+
# RESETIUS |   y=-[c40+@.5g--@2.414g|@q2f++f+++@q2f]x+fw+
